<title>CHINA: Zhejiang Expressway declares 1st results.</title>
<headline>Zhejiang Expressway declares 1st results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		0.047 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	 nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil</p>
<p>    Net			 99.85</p>
<p>    Turnover		  273.84</p>
<p>    Company name	    Zhejiang Expressway Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Zhejiang Expressway, a toll road operator in China's eastern province of Zhejiang, was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on May 15. It issued 1.25 billion H-shares in a global flotation.</p>
<p>Share earnings adjusted for the issue of H-shares</p>
